# Empirically-derived limits from our own testing on a 64 GB M4 Studio:
#
#   T2V/I2V Q4 standard at 1280×704: ~38 GB peak, fine on 32 GB w/ a bit of swap
#   T2V/I2V Q4 standard at 768×432:  ~22 GB peak, fine anywhere
